{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107700","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107700","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710770001:1":{"text":"놀라게 해 드려 죄송합니다만, 조금 전까지 연회장에는 아무도 없었습니다. 그 사이에... 어디에 다녀오신 겁니까?","source_cn":"请原谅我的惊讶。但就在刚才，这座大厅还空无一人。可否请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3532B15F6B7526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710770002:1":{"text":"표정을 보아하니 훌륭한 만찬을 즐기신 것 같지는 않아 보입니다만...","source_cn":"看你们的神色，并非在享受一场美妙的晚宴啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38A45EAE08BC66B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710770003:1":{"text":"딜그레이 경, 마침 잘 오셨습니다요! ","source_cn":"迪尔格雷大人！您来得正好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6B8DD85A9E8AD79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710770004:1":{"text":"저, 저희는... 고대의 전당에 갔었습니다. 사라졌던 그 고대의 전당이요!","source_cn":"我们、我们去了圣古堂！那个消失的圣古堂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3F5D5C9F5F29C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710770005:1":{"text":"그뿐만이 아니라... 마물이 있었어요! 역사책에서만 봤던... 그 “거울의 마령”이 있었다고요!","source_cn":"不仅如此！还有……还有魔物！就是史书上的那个魔灵镜影！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC9EE2412B0E6F26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710770006:1":{"text":"하지만 왕자님께서... 오리안 왕자님께서...","source_cn":"但！但是王子殿下……奥利安殿下他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBE72B6EA9A370F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710770007:1":{"text":"왕자님께서 그 마물을 쓰러뜨리셨습니다. 진정한 영웅이시죠!","source_cn":"王子殿下是英雄！他、他把那个魔物打倒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x679B264115FCAB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710770008:1":{"text":"마치 로란 대제님께서 살아 돌아오신 줄 알았습니다요! 저희 모두가 똑똑히 봤다니까요!","source_cn":"就像罗兰大帝一样！我们都亲眼看到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16F0DC28A0AD76C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710770009:1":{"text":"오? 그런 기적이 있었습니까.","source_cn":"哦？竟有此等神迹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C780C8CBF3C0E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710770010:1":{"text":"...잠깐만요. 마물이 쓰러지고 저희 모두 돌아왔는데...","source_cn":"……等等。既然魔物被打倒了，我们也都回来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6C403E774828279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710770011:1":{"text":"왕자님은 어디 계시죠?","source_cn":"王子殿下呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC68203EE23053C88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710770012:1":{"text":"설마... 저희를 구하고 그곳에 갇히신 건가요?!","source_cn":"难道……殿下他为了救我们，还被困在那该死的教堂里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2260848BDBDA5CBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710770013:1":{"text":"이, 이걸 어떻게 해야 합니까!","source_cn":"这……这可如何是好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14C65680FA027199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710770014:1":{"text":"...딜그레이 경, 그대는 수석 궁정 마법사 아니오. 어떻게 생각하시오?","source_cn":"……迪尔格雷卿，你是宫廷首席法师。对此，你有什么看法？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFDDF06C00923F5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710770015:1":{"text":"여러분, 진정하시고 방금 목격한 것을 차분히 되짚어 보십시오.","source_cn":"诸位，请冷静。请仔细回想你们所见证的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D26369D913C74F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710770016:1":{"text":"그... 그게 무슨 말씀입니까?","source_cn":"这……您的意思是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x285EA063AEF4F962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710770017:1":{"text":"과연 이게 재앙일까요? 아니요, 이건 <style=\"highlight\">시련</style>입니다. 그리고 여러분은 이 신성한 시련을 직접 목격한 증인이시지요.","source_cn":"这难道是一场灾难吗？不，这是一场<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD6CD0A2E360A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710770018:1":{"text":"오리안 왕자님께서는 갇힌 게 아니라 <style=\"highlight\">선택받으신 겁니다</style>. 인간의 몸으로 마물을 쓰러뜨리고, 백성을 지킨 것이야 말로 과거 로란 대제님께서 걸으셨던 제왕의 길 아닙니까!","source_cn":"奥利安殿下并非被困住了。他是被<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB2D71B63AE0874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710770019:1":{"text":"여러분이 무사히 돌아온 것은 증인의 사명을 다 하셨기 때문입니다. 그리고 왕자님께서 그곳에 잠시 머무는 까닭은...","source_cn":"你们平安归来，是因为你们的见证使命已经完成。而殿下之所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB57745AE1E9BCC70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710770020:1":{"text":"성소에서 <style=\"highlight\">하늘의 대관식</style>을 기다리고 있다는 뜻이 아니겠습니까??","source_cn":"难道不是意味着，他正在那座神圣的殿堂里，等待接受<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD6DFACEAE5A9CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710770021:1":{"text":"대관식이라니... 설마 칼리번 말이오?","source_cn":"接受加冕……你是说，石中剑？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1B652868FCAE3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710770022:1":{"text":"...마, 맞습니다! 이건 시련입니다. 시련입죠! 저희는 선택받은 증인이고, 오리안 왕자님께서는 하늘의 선택을 받으신 게 분명합니다!","source_cn":"……没错！是试炼！一定是试炼！我们是被选中的见证者！奥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0352C1637B424974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1710770023:1":{"text":"그럼 왕자님은 언제 돌아오시나요?","source_cn":"那殿下什么时候才能回来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B20C3CD6F52541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710770024:1":{"text":"걱정 마십시오. 왕자님은 반드시 돌아오실 것입니다! 그리고 돌아오실 때는 사라진 고대의 전당과 듀라 여신님의 영광을 함께 이끌고 오실 겁니다!","source_cn":"无需担忧。王子殿下必将归来！而且，当他归来之时，他必将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA3A748C1E7C0B8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1710770025:1":{"text":"레오프론에... 진정한 기적이 내리겠지요!","source_cn":"耀光……将迎来真正的神迹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC2F1860076B7F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1710770026:1":{"text":"하늘의 선택이라니... 이것이야말로 진정한 여신님의 뜻입니다!","source_cn":"天命所归……这才是真正的天命所归啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC377BE9C8258BBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1710770027:1":{"text":"오늘 밤 연회는 여기서 마무리해야 할 것 같습니다.","source_cn":"诸位。今夜的宴会，已经没有继续的必要了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FCCE4B0834E9B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1710770028:1":{"text":"다들 돌아가 쉬십시오. 그리고... 함께 오리안 왕자님의...","source_cn":"请先行回去休息，养足精神。然后……让我们一起静候奥利安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE047EBCB6B3AE3F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1710770029:1":{"text":"영광스러운 귀환을 기다립시다.","source_cn":"……凯旋而归。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E058EF15D7E1F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:迪尔格雷":{"text":"딜그레이","source":"迪尔格雷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:男爵葛朗台":{"text":"그랑데트 남작","source":"男爵葛朗台","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:女公爵梦妮":{"text":"몬니 공작","source":"女公爵梦妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伯爵坦尼斯":{"text":"타니스 백작","source":"伯爵坦尼斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大臣康斯曼":{"text":"콘스만 대신","source":"大臣康斯曼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亲王孔蒂":{"text":"콘티 대공","source":"亲王孔蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"